{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "65a134e5069afac4db2444338ae5266eda702a24e440037266ceb8f678de8b73", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8e8e57221349907ffb6c832422417348555d24041af08410f59c632587c53ebe", "ja": "ああ、まつりか。この前のライブはお疲れだったな。\nだいぶ寒かったけど、風邪とかひいてないか？", "zh": "哎呀，原来是茉莉。之前的演唱会辛苦你了。\n最近很冷，你应该没感冒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "c2a33ea9d02cb906cd728304f58901113c0473ce78097a0ca2f9490970582f6c", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん、\nまつりのこと心配してるのですか？", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生，\n你在替茉莉担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "698367b51032717d58c10b1a025d665e46c79aa36ee2d258f01e9e3463048fa6", "ja": "天気はよかったけど、1日中外だったしな。\nまつりだって寒かっただろ？", "zh": "虽然天气不错，但毕竟一整天都待在外头嘛。\n就算是茉莉也会觉得冷吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c7f173904f39f150c9f9e662676d6c5b678a833aa4e3743017bf905de104436", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、心配性なのです。\nあれくらい、まつりはへっちゃらなのですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你真是爱操心的喔。\n这种天气对茉莉来说根本不算什么的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e50c42cb0b1953c616e59246a84fba2505c09842cfbb8177725a0d281c517238", "ja": "そうか、それならいいんだけど……\nでももし辛かったら、すぐに言わなきゃダメだぞ。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……\n不过要是你觉得不舒服，一定要马上跟我说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f72d7f024b8eb75f20e6f1b5d8dfa465a9a3a37fd824ebf00f8d8cdbc4b8c5c", "ja": "はいなのです♪　でもそれは、\n{$P$}さんもなのですよ？", "zh": "好的喔♪不过，\n{$P$}先生，你也是的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a42c6d0ac4052624b50c0ec255fa2c64d011ff38ea7d741c907b416830f88334", "ja": "俺？", "zh": "我也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "9fea7a80f430ae1250216057aa2071a88e68a86d2b8abfe62905114d845eea03", "ja": "くらくらしたり、顔が熱くなってきたりしたら、\nまつりに言うのです。妖精さんが治してくれるのです♪", "zh": "要是觉得头昏脑胀、脸蛋发烫的话，\n要跟茉莉讲喔。会有妖精帮你治好的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "467d7791ecf90e19f090a21b585758f381ee817bc603c2492ba5c4e9cd67aae6", "ja": "はは、妖精さんか。\nそうだな、じゃあ風邪をひいたら頼らせてもらうよ。", "zh": "哈哈，妖精是吧。\n好啊，我感冒的时候就拜托你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "e844578bab5bb34c58469e5db9e114bb61cbee08c6b60c85764c47e6150e4d5a", "ja": "はいなのです♪　……{$P$}さん、\n今は大丈夫なのですか？　ちょっと顔が赤いのです。", "zh": "好的喔♪……{$P$}先生，\n你现在没事吧？你的脸好红喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d0b4978b6ebe481e5ace7e2cded74d4cad76d968e54b31cd81b15c3afa07ce61", "ja": "え？　そうか？\n本当に風邪をひいたのかな……。", "zh": "咦？有吗？\n该不会我真的感冒了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "e3314b9f27d18eb74c01a2517353d2346323fca47a747fdaee0b33344d626807", "ja": "はいほー！　まつりが、お熱をはかってあげるのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho！让茉莉帮你量体温吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "afc290a60f80b6f3c9aafbc933a021967930bb798c440ad30db2666b93abdd0d", "ja": "え？　いや、いいから……うわっ！？", "zh": "什么？不用了，我没事的……哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "09fc5d0154cba97d3aba6f954d2fbb5c06185374939dfd5d2be4ec21ab475135", "ja": "じっとしてなきゃダメなのです。\n……ほら。顔も赤いし、少し熱っぽい。", "zh": "不可以乱动喔。\n……你看，脸都变红了，也有点发烫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "c76d673e0c15751b9fed6431a0b614b6cfdc076576b1b7159a829043233071c9", "ja": "ダメだよ、自分のことは大切にしないと。\nあなたはひとりしかいないし、大切な体なんだから。", "zh": "这样不行啊，要珍惜自己的身体才行。\n你是独一无二的，你的身体也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b7749c04a6738c203993a0cad249ec18d90a39a7b9bd3daa380f781f2fb9388c", "ja": "ま、まつり……？", "zh": "茉、茉莉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "c0ac181d1d9307b2a4cb4d03555b528ed30ecfb3357e8d41aa37a4f4a2c667f9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今日はもう帰るのです。\nまた明日、お仕事頑張るのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天先回去吧。\n明天再来打拚工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0053_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "e31b11a850b286c4cc7eee55d20d560e770b243bffed861d4f0f4befceac5c0b", "ja": "お仕事も姫も、逃げたりしないのです。\nだから、今日はもう、おやすみなさい。また、明日。", "zh": "工作和公主都不会跑走的喔。\n所以，今天就先休息吧。明天见啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
